  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bleach-gui-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbleach-gui-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord-plural\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Kesselspacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"youtube-plural\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkesselot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\" alt=\"kofi-singular-alt\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/documentation/website_vector.svg\" alt=\"website\"></a></p><h1>總覽</h1><p>來自深受喜愛的動漫/漫畫《BLEACH 死神》。享受全面翻新的 Minecraft 圖形使用者介面體驗，包含所有可愛的死神女性角色，當然還有混血英雄黑崎一護 <del>藍染</del>。</p><h2>推薦模組包</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/burichi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Burichi (死神)</strong></a></li>\n</ul><h1>預覽 - 更多內容請查看畫廊！</h1><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/I0CPtcES/images/fe620aced9773a979800aecc3723674ae67aca63.png\" alt=\"大型箱子選單\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/I0CPtcES/images/3662def5114dc634121d9ef57bf60167d6b209ce.png\" alt=\"鐵砧選單\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/I0CPtcES/images/e167b737614637c1710b05a4b6b55869a0cb35dc.png\" alt=\"鍛造台選單\"></p><h3>資源包注意事項</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>如果您是使用此資源包的 YouTuber 或內容創作者，請在描述中放置連結，導回此頁面，讓觀眾知道您使用的資源包。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>不允許在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上重新上傳此資源包或任何修改版本，這包括將資源包分發至任何其他網站。</strong>（<em>除非獲得我本人的明確許可</em>）</li>\n</ul>",
